IsTargetNeutralModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Checks target independence of the whole IR: runs ValidateFunc for every function and accumulates the result. Returns 1 if no instruction/operand contains forbidden target-specific tokens (HasForbidden), otherwise 0.
    Provides: IsTargetNeutral(ir) -> ok.
    DependsOn: ValidateFunc (per-function check).
    Composition: Native include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../IsTargetNeutral/IsTargetNeutral.sir).
